cultural and barn construction, as well as other products/services that naturally belong with this, including participating in other companies with similar activities, and buying and selling shares or otherwise acquiring interests in other enterprises. Its main industry code is 68.120: development of building projects. In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 17 858 069 NOK and the annual result was 2 816 684 NOK; operating income was up from 6 593 948 NOK in 2024. The annual result rose from 36 529 NOK in 2024 to 2 816 684 NOK in 2025. Equity rose from 731 223 NOK in 2024 to 3 040 907 NOK in 2025. The register's most recent update was on 2026-07-11 (fravalgRevisjonBeslutningsDato, fravalgRevisjonDato).","sentences":[{"text":"PREBYGG NORGE AS is a private limited company registered in Tustna, founded 2017-08-15.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c7"]},{"text":"PREBYGG NORGE AS develops, produces, markets and sells Prebygg, which is regarded as a complete concept for agricultural and barn construction, as well as other products/services that naturally belong with this, including participating in other companies with similar activities, and buying and selling shares or otherwise acquiring interests in other enterprises.","claim_ids":["c11","c10"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 68.120: development of building projects.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 17 858 069 NOK and the annual result was 2 816 684 NOK; operating income was up from 6 593 948 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c46","c51","c35"]},{"text":"The annual result rose from 36 529 NOK in 2024 to 2 816 684 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c40","c51"]},{"text":"Equity rose from 731 223 NOK in 2024 to 3 040 907 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c43","c54"]},{"text":"The register's most recent update was on 2026-07-11 (fravalgRevisjonBeslutningsDato, fravalgRevisjonDato).","claim_ids":["c63"]}],"unknowns":["Employee count: The register shows no registered employee count for th